      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name}: Yes. This was my first map so i'm using a bunch of model packs from the unity store, i don't think any of those should be a problem though but i can make a list of them if you want me to.\nFor unity assets/tools i'm using:\n- ProBuilder 4.5.0\n- VRWorld Toolkit 1.11.2 (used to setup post processing)\n- TextMeshPro 1.5.1\n- Sketchfab browser/importer\nFor udon prefabs i'm not using any.\nAs far as udon scripts in this project, i only have one teleporter, one door animation, one world music mute and a few pickupable objects, nothing fancy.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
