      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just managed to figure out the problem. As I haven't touched this map is a bit, it was still on and old SDK3 version from the end of may (2021.05.21.12.13) So now I updated the SDK3 to the latest version and it looks like it imported correctly to Unity 2019 (at least i got no errors and didn't find any problems with a quick look at the project).\nMy suggestion would be adding \"make sure your project has the latest 2018 SDK before starting the migration process\" to the migration guide as a Step 1, even before making a backup of the U2018 version of the project.\nThis will save some trouble for people porting older projects that haven't been worked at in a couple months.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
